chx:SignatureFoundations owl:disjointWith chx:SegwitSigning .
chx:SignatureFoundations owl:disjointWith chx:SinceTheBook .
chx:SighashFlags owl:disjointWith chx:SchnorrSignatures .
chx:SighashFlags owl:disjointWith chx:EcdsaSignatures .
chx:SighashFlags owl:disjointWith chx:Randomness .
chx:SighashFlags owl:disjointWith chx:SegwitSigning .
chx:SighashFlags owl:disjointWith chx:SinceTheBook .
chx:SchnorrSignatures owl:disjointWith chx:EcdsaSignatures .
chx:SchnorrSignatures owl:disjointWith chx:Randomness .
chx:SchnorrSignatures owl:disjointWith chx:SegwitSigning .
chx:SchnorrSignatures owl:disjointWith chx:SinceTheBook .
chx:EcdsaSignatures owl:disjointWith chx:Randomness .
chx:EcdsaSignatures owl:disjointWith chx:SegwitSigning .
chx:EcdsaSignatures owl:disjointWith chx:SinceTheBook .
chx:Randomness owl:disjointWith chx:SegwitSigning .
chx:Randomness owl:disjointWith chx:SinceTheBook .
chx:SegwitSigning owl:disjointWith chx:SinceTheBook .

#################################################################
# Connectedness repair (discipline v2.19.0, BP-D56 and BP-D57), 2026-10-19.
# The datatype properties the A-Box uses and nothing declared, then the relations
# between the chapter's subject branches that the chapter's own sources state.
#################################################################
chx:input a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "input expression"@en ; rdfs:comment "The expression an input/output example evaluates."@en ; rdfs:domain rd:IOExample ; rdfs:range xsd:string ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
chx:output a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "output value"@en ; rdfs:comment "The value that evaluating the example expression gives."@en ; rdfs:domain rd:IOExample ; rdfs:range xsd:string ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
chx:mayNameHashType a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "may name a hash type of"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "In taproot one more byte of a signature may name a hash type. Basis: the chapter says of Schnorr signature sizes: 'in taproot one more byte may name a hash type'; the chapter says of Valid taproot hash types: 'A taproot signature may use only the hash types'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:SignatureSizes ; rdfs:range chx:TaprootHashTypes ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
chx:endsWithHashType a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "ends with a byte holding"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A DER signature in Bitcoin is followed by the hash type byte. Basis: the chapter says of Layout of a DER signature: 'followed in Bitcoin by the hash type byte'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:DerLayout ; rdfs:range chx:FlagValues ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
chx:changesDigestCommitment a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "shows what the flag covers of"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Changing a field that a flag covers changes the hash of the signed input. Basis: the chapter says of Matrix of commitments: 'changing a field that the flag covers changes the hash of the signed input'; the chapter says of The signed digest: 'What a signature signs is a hash computed from selected fields of the transaction'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:CommitmentMatrix ; rdfs:range chx:DigestCommitment ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
chx:includesAmountInDigest a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "adds the amount to"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "In BIP143 the signature hash includes the amount of the coin being spent. Basis: the chapter says of Commitment to the amount (BIP143): 'the signature hash includes the amount of the coin being spent'; the chapter says of The signed digest: 'What a signature signs is a hash computed from selected fields of the transaction'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:AmountCommitment ; rdfs:range chx:DigestCommitment ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
chx:limitedByAnyoneCanPay a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "is limited by"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A taproot signature commits to the amounts of all inputs unless ANYONECANPAY is used. Basis: the chapter says of Commitment to all amounts (BIP341): 'unless ANYONECANPAY is used, when it commits only to its own'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:TaprootAmounts ; rdfs:range chx:AnyoneCanPayEffect ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
chx:rejectsZeroHashType a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "rejects an explicit zero hash type of"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Bitcoin Core 31.1 rejects an explicit zero hash type in a taproot signature. Basis: the chapter says of Core's taproot verdicts: 'rejects an explicit zero hash type'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:TaprootVerdicts ; rdfs:range chx:TaprootHashTypes ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
chx:holdsSchnorrSignature a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "holds a signature of the size of"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The first taproot key-path spend has a witness holding a 64-byte schnorr signature. Basis: the chapter says of A first taproot spend: 'a one-element witness holding a 64-byte schnorr signature'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:FirstTaprootSpend ; rdfs:range chx:SignatureSizes ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
chx:usesEcdsaFormulas a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "uses the formulas of"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The signature the chapter's signer makes is the one from RFC 6979's nonce and the plain ECDSA formulas. Basis: the chapter says of Library nonce matches the standard: 'RFC 6979's nonce and the plain ECDSA formulas'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:LibraryNonceMatches ; rdfs:range chx:EcdsaFormulas ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
chx:reusesEcdsaNonce a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "breaks the signer of"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "If two ECDSA signatures from the same key use the same nonce k, anyone can compute the private key. Basis: the chapter says of Nonce reuse: 'If two ECDSA signatures from the same key use the same nonce k'; the chapter says of ECDSA formulas: 'ECDSA signs with a random nonce k'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:NonceReuse ; rdfs:range chx:EcdsaFormulas ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
chx:setsAuxiliaryValue a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "sets the auxiliary data of"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Bitcoin Core's sign.cpp has the zero auxiliary value that the default BIP340 nonce takes. Basis: the chapter says of Grinding in the source: 'sign.cpp has the zero auxiliary value'; the chapter says of The default BIP340 nonce: 'derives its nonce from the key, the message and auxiliary data'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:GrindingSource ; rdfs:range chx:DefaultNonce ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
chx:changesSchnorrSigning a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "changes"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The secp256k1 library removed its deprecated function alias for schnorr signing. Basis: the chapter says of Changes in libsecp256k1: 'removed its deprecated function alias for schnorr signing'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:LibsecpChanges ; rdfs:range chx:SchnorrSignatures ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
chx:supportsMuSig a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "supports"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Bitcoin Core 30.0 added the musig() descriptor and the MuSig2 fields of PSBT. Basis: the chapter says of musig() in Bitcoin Core: 'Bitcoin Core 30.0 added the musig() descriptor and the MuSig2 fields of PSBT'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:CoreMusigSupport ; rdfs:range chx:MuSigKeyAgg ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
chx:lacksThresholdBip a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "finds no BIP for"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The BIP index has no entry for a threshold signature scheme. Basis: the chapter says of No threshold BIP: 'The BIP index has no entry for a threshold signature scheme'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:ThresholdBipGap ; rdfs:range chx:ThresholdSharing ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
chx:statesSigopsLimit a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "states"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The release notes of Bitcoin Core 30.0 state the limit of 2,500 legacy signature operations. Basis: the chapter says of Release note of Core 30.0: 'state the limit of 2,500 legacy signature operations'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:Core30Sigops ; rdfs:range chx:LegacySigopsCap ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch08/tbox> .
